l-new arcade mode!\n- Experience realistic physics that bring the ball to life in Mixed Reality!\n\n# Use hand tracking to control the ball \u2013 no controllers needed!\n{558691627060910}\n\n# Arcade mode with maps only available in Mixed Reality!\n\n{8515711355206315}\n\n# Scale the ball to any size, move it around your room, and create your perfect gameplay setup.\n\n{986706286830904}\n\n# Interact with your loyal flying droid companion \u2013 or just annoy it for fun!\n\n{546369714954430}\n\n# Upcoming features - \n- **Speed run online leaderboard.**\n- **Level builder.**\n- **Ball decals.**\n- **And much more to come!! Wishlist NOW!**\n\nEarly gameplay footage was captured on the Meta Quest 3.", "short_description": "Control the ball with Hand Tracking in Mixed Reality! Enjoy realistic physics while solving mazes, avoiding falls, and exploring amazing levels."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.kissistudio.com/mazeball-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kissi Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.kissistudio.com/mazeball", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8250536591679485"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 11, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "722406380826663"}, {"status":